Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.44,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,80)\blur1.95}Te alcançarei ao amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.31,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,180)\blur1.95}As sombras aparecem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:09.52,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Ilusões nascem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:13.65,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,120)\blur1.95}Os anjos caídos que te acompanham não sabem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:18.10,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur1.95}É a nossa dor que nos torna humanos, afinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Fotografias em sépia antigas mostram
